  "name": "@gravity8/dillie-mcp",
  "readme": "<a id=\"top\"></a>\n\nEnglish | [\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4](#korean)\n\n# @gravity8/dillie-mcp\n\nAn MCP server that exposes [dillie](https://dillie.work) projects/tasks as [Model Context Protocol](https://modelcontextprotocol.io) tools. It is built on `@gravity8/dillie-sdk`. It has its own client identity (`mcp-dillie`) and therefore its own credentials store, separate from the CLI.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nThis MCP server does not provide its own login flow. Log in with `@gravity8/dillie-cli`, selecting the MCP client identity so the session is issued for this server.\n\n```sh\nnpx @gravity8/dillie-cli login --client mcp-dillie\n```\n\nThe CLI and this server are separate clients, so each needs its own session and each is registered as its own device. Revoking one does not sign out the other.\n\nIf you call a tool while unauthenticated, it returns a message guiding you to run `dillie login`.\n\n## Install & register\n\nRegister the server in your AI agent's MCP configuration (Claude Code, Claude Desktop, etc.) as shown below. `npx` downloads and runs the latest version on demand, so no separate installation is required.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"dillie\": {\n      \"command\": \"npx\",\n      \"args\": [\"-y\", \"@gravity8/dillie-mcp\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\nEnvironment variables behave the same as in `@gravity8/dillie-cli` (the config is shared).\n\n| Environment variable      | Default                                                         | Description                  |\n| ------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `DILLIE_API_BASE_URL`     | `https://dillie.work`                                           | dillie API base URL          |\n| `DILLIE_CREDENTIALS_PATH` | `${XDG_CONFIG_HOME or ~/.config}/dillie/mcp-dillie/credentials` | Path to the credentials file |\n| `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`         | (defaults to `~/.config` if unset)                              | XDG config root              |\n\n## Provided tools\n\n| Tool                           | Description                                                                             |\n| ------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `dillie_whoami`                | Checks the current login state (workspace label / tenantId).                            |\n| `dillie_list_projects`         | Lists projects, filterable by status and name search.                                   |\n| `dillie_get_project`           | Fetches project details by project ID.                                                  |\n| `dillie_create_project`        | Creates a new project (optionally with a `agile-scrum`/`agile-kanban` template).        |\n| `dillie_get_project_resources` | Fetches a project's sub-resource IDs (e.g. task list `listId`).                         |\n| `dillie_list_members`          | Lists a project's members.                                                              |\n| `dillie_list_fields`           | Fetches a task list's field definitions (name/type/role).                               |\n| `dillie_query_tasks`           | Queries tasks with filter/sort/cursor pagination (supports resolving assignee by name). |\n| `dillie_create_task`           | Creates a task (list item).                                                             |\n| `dillie_update_task`           | Updates an existing task's field values, parent item, or color.                         |\n| `dillie_list_sprints`          | Lists sprints for a list (Agile mode).                                                  |\n\nEach tool declares its input schema, which your MCP client surfaces automatically when it lists the available tools.\n\n## License\n\nLicensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"korean\"></a>\n\n# \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4\n\n[English](#top) | \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4\n\n# @gravity8/dillie-mcp\n\n[dillie](https://dillie.work) \ud504\ub85c\uc81d\ud2b8/\ud0dc\uc2a4\ud06c\ub97c [Model Context Protocol](https://modelcontextprotocol.io) \ub3c4\uad6c\ub85c \ub178\ucd9c\ud558\ub294 MCP \uc11c\ubc84. `@gravity8/dillie-sdk` \uc704\uc5d0 \uad6c\ud604\ub418\uba70, `@gravity8/dillie-cli`\uc640 \ub85c\uceec \uc790\uaca9\uc99d\uba85 \uc800\uc7a5\uc18c(`~/.config/dillie/credentials`)\ub97c \uacf5\uc720\ud55c\ub2e4.\n\n## \uc120\ud589 \uc870\uac74\n\n\uc774 MCP \uc11c\ubc84\ub294 \ubcc4\ub3c4\uc758 \ub85c\uadf8\uc778 \uae30\ub2a5\uc744 \uc81c\uacf5\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\ub294\ub2e4. \uba3c\uc800 `@gravity8/dillie-cli`\ub85c \ub85c\uadf8\uc778\ud574 \uc790\uaca9\uc99d\uba85\uc744 \ub85c\uceec\uc5d0 \uc800\uc7a5\ud574\uc57c \ud55c\ub2e4.\n\n```sh\nnpx @gravity8/dillie-cli login --client mcp-dillie\n```\n\nCLI \uc640 \uc774 \uc11c\ubc84\ub294 \ubcc4\uac1c \ud074\ub77c\uc774\uc5b8\ud2b8\ub77c \uac01\uc790 \uc138\uc158\uc774 \uc11c\uace0 \uac01\uc790 \uae30\uae30\ub85c \ub4f1\ub85d\ub41c\ub2e4. \ud55c\ucabd\uc744 \ud3d0\uae30\ud574\ub3c4 \ub2e4\ub978 \ucabd\uc740 \uc0b4\uc544 \uc788\ub2e4.\n\n\ubbf8\uc778\uc99d \uc0c1\ud0dc\uc5d0\uc11c \ub3c4\uad6c\ub97c \ud638\ucd9c\ud558\uba74 `dillie login` \uc2e4\ud589\uc744 \uc548\ub0b4\ud558\ub294 \uba54\uc2dc\uc9c0\ub97c \ubc18\ud658\ud55c\ub2e4.\n\n## \uc124\uce58 \ubc0f \ub4f1\ub85d\n\nAI \uc5d0\uc774\uc804\ud2b8(Claude Code, Claude Desktop \ub4f1)\uc758 MCP \uc124\uc815\uc5d0 \uc544\ub798\uc640 \uac19\uc774 \ub4f1\ub85d\ud55c\ub2e4. `npx`\uac00 \ucd5c\uc2e0 \ubc84\uc804\uc744 \uadf8\ub54c\uadf8\ub54c \ub0b4\ub824\ubc1b\uc544 \uc2e4\ud589\ud558\ubbc0\ub85c \ubcc4\ub3c4 \uc124\uce58\uac00 \ud544\uc694 \uc5c6\ub2e4.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"dillie\": {\n      \"command\": \"npx\",\n      \"args\": [\"-y\", \"@gravity8/dillie-mcp\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## \uc124\uc815\n\n\ud658\uacbd\ubcc0\uc218\ub294 `@gravity8/dillie-cli`\uc640 \ub3d9\uc77c\ud558\uac8c \ub3d9\uc791\ud55c\ub2e4.\n\n| \ud658\uacbd\ubcc0\uc218                  | \uae30\ubcf8\uac12                                                            | \uc124\uba85                |\n| ------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `DILLIE_API_BASE_URL`     | `https://dillie.work`                                             | dillie API base URL |\n| `DILLIE_CREDENTIALS_PATH` | `${XDG_CONFIG_HOME \ub610\ub294 ~/.config}/dillie/mcp-dillie/credentials` | \uc790\uaca9\uc99d\uba85 \ud30c\uc77c \uacbd\ub85c  |\n| `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`         | (\ubbf8\uc9c0\uc815 \uc2dc `~/.config` \uc0ac\uc6a9)                                      | XDG \uc124\uc815 \ub8e8\ud2b8       |\n\n## \uc81c\uacf5 \ub3c4\uad6c\n\n| \ub3c4\uad6c                           | \uc124\uba85                                                                           |\n| ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `dillie_whoami`                | \ud604\uc7ac \ub85c\uadf8\uc778 \uc0c1\ud0dc(\uc6cc\ud06c\uc2a4\ud398\uc774\uc2a4 \ub77c\ubca8/tenantId)\ub97c \ud655\uc778\ud55c\ub2e4.                       |\n| `dillie_list_projects`         | \ud504\ub85c\uc81d\ud2b8 \ubaa9\ub85d\uc744 \uc0c1\ud0dc/\uc774\ub984 \uac80\uc0c9\uc5b4\ub85c \ud544\ud130\ub9c1\ud574 \uc870\ud68c\ud55c\ub2e4.                          |\n| `dillie_get_project`           | \ud504\ub85c\uc81d\ud2b8 ID \ub85c \uc0c1\uc138 \uc815\ubcf4\ub97c \uc870\ud68c\ud55c\ub2e4.                                           |\n| `dillie_create_project`        | \uc0c8 \ud504\ub85c\uc81d\ud2b8\ub97c \uc0dd\uc131\ud55c\ub2e4(agile-scrum/agile-kanban \ud15c\ud50c\ub9bf \uc9c0\uc815 \uac00\ub2a5).             |\n| `dillie_get_project_resources` | \ud504\ub85c\uc81d\ud2b8 \ud558\uc704 \ub9ac\uc18c\uc2a4 ID(\ud0dc\uc2a4\ud06c \ub9ac\uc2a4\ud2b8 listId \ub4f1)\ub97c \uc870\ud68c\ud55c\ub2e4.                   |\n| `dillie_list_members`          | \ud504\ub85c\uc81d\ud2b8 \uba64\ubc84 \ubaa9\ub85d\uc744 \uc870\ud68c\ud55c\ub2e4.                                                 |\n| `dillie_list_fields`           | \ud0dc\uc2a4\ud06c \ub9ac\uc2a4\ud2b8\uc758 \ud544\ub4dc \uc815\uc758(\uc774\ub984/\ud0c0\uc785/role)\ub97c \uc870\ud68c\ud55c\ub2e4.                          |\n| `dillie_query_tasks`           | \ud0dc\uc2a4\ud06c\ub97c \ud544\ud130/\uc815\ub82c/\ucee4\uc11c \ud398\uc774\uc9c0\ub124\uc774\uc158\uc73c\ub85c \uc870\ud68c\ud55c\ub2e4(\ub2f4\ub2f9\uc790 \uc774\ub984 \uc790\ub3d9 \ud574\uc11d \uc9c0\uc6d0). |\n| `dillie_create_task`           | \ud0dc\uc2a4\ud06c(\ub9ac\uc2a4\ud2b8 \uc544\uc774\ud15c)\ub97c \uc0dd\uc131\ud55c\ub2e4.                                              |\n| `dillie_update_task`           | \uae30\uc874 \ud0dc\uc2a4\ud06c\uc758 \ud544\ub4dc \uac12/\uc0c1\uc704 \uc544\uc774\ud15c/\uc0c9\uc0c1\uc744 \uc218\uc815\ud55c\ub2e4.                             |\n| `dillie_list_sprints`          | \ub9ac\uc2a4\ud2b8(\uc560\uc790\uc77c \ubaa8\ub4dc)\uc758 \uc2a4\ud504\ub9b0\ud2b8 \ubaa9\ub85d\uc744 \uc870\ud68c\ud55c\ub2e4.                                |\n\n\uac01 \ub3c4\uad6c\ub294 \uc785\ub825 \uc2a4\ud0a4\ub9c8\ub97c \uc120\uc5b8\ud558\uba70, MCP \ud074\ub77c\uc774\uc5b8\ud2b8\uac00 \uc0ac\uc6a9 \uac00\ub2a5\ud55c \ub3c4\uad6c \ubaa9\ub85d\uc744 \uc870\ud68c\ud560 \ub54c \uadf8 \ud30c\ub77c\ubbf8\ud130\ub97c \uc790\ub3d9\uc73c\ub85c \ud45c\uc2dc\ud55c\ub2e4.\n\n## \ub77c\uc774\uc120\uc2a4\n\nApache License, Version 2.0 \ub77c\uc774\uc120\uc2a4\ub85c \ubc30\ud3ec\ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n",
